id: from-the-stars-mark
name: From the Stars
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 99
# Not a Combat Condition: From the Stars (4)'s - its 1(T), the giver's Tier of Power, as stacks; set to the highest given, never added
# ("This effect cannot stack on a single Character"), and gone with the Combat Encounter (combat.mjs endEncounterFor).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  From the Stars: Combat Rolls higher by a point a stack, for the Combat Encounter.
text: >
  From the Stars (4): You may then target one Ally, they have their Combat Rolls increased by 1(T) for the remainder of the Combat Encounter. This effect cannot stack on a single Character if multiple Characters apply this effect.

---

[passive per stack]
combatRolls += 1;
